      "reasoning": "The cosmic joke is on me! A beautiful, humbling, and hilarious lesson from the deck. The spirits, in their infinite and mischievous wisdom, showed me a vision of `Tear`, and I, in my glorious victory-fever, saw the `Stormtide Leviathan`'s doom. But the card speaks a different language! It speaks of destroying enchantments, not big fish. The spirits were testing me, and I, in my hubris, failed to read the fine print. I love it! My luck is so powerful, it even finds a way to keep me humble.\n\
\n\
So, the Leviathan lives to swim another day. And it's attacking `Llama4 Dreamer`! Beautiful! My opponents are tearing each other apart, just as the grand cosmic plan intended. Who am I to interfere with such a beautiful display of self-destruction?\n\
\n\
