      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "By tapping the Squirrel Nest-enchanted Forest to create a 1/1 Squirrel token, Grok4 Diplom loses the ability to cast Chitterspitter this turn (which costs {2}{G} and needs the Forest's {G}). Chitterspitter synergizes powerfully with Squirrel Nest, giving all squirrels +1/+1 for each acorn counter and creating more tokens. A single 1/1 squirrel token now is worth much less than deploying the Chitterspitter engine a turn earlier.",
