      "player": "Grok4 Diplom",
      "decision_index": 86,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Failed to activate Chitterspitter before passing, wasting available mana. Golgari Rot Farm was untapped and could produce {G} to activate Chitterspitter, creating a 2/2 Squirrel token (1/1 base +1/+1 from acorn counter). This is a pure upside activated ability with no downside, and the mana would go unused.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without activating any abilities or casting any spells",
      "better_line": "Activate Chitterspitter using {G} from Golgari Rot Farm to create a 2/2 Squirrel token before passing priority",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 209,
      "player": "Grok4 Diplom",
      "decision_index": 89,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Grok4 Diplom passed without playing Tranquil Thicket as their land drop or activating Chitterspitter to create a squirrel token. Missing a land drop is free value lost, and creating a 2/2 squirrel (buffed by the acorn counter on Chitterspitter) with available green mana from Golgari Rot Farm is pure upside.",
      "action_taken": "Passed without taking any action, missing both a land drop and a free creature token.",
      "better_line": "Play Tranquil Thicket as the land drop and activate Chitterspitter to create a 2/2 Squirrel token using {G} from Golgari Rot Farm.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 219,
      "player": "Grok4 Diplom",
      "decision_index": 92,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem25P Lucky declined to attack with Sinister Concierge when no opponents had blockers, leaving 2 free damage on the table. While keeping Concierge back for potential casualty 2 sacrifices or its death trigger has some value, dealing free unblocked damage in a multiplayer game where life totals matter is generally correct.",
      "action_taken": "Did not attack with Sinister Concierge, only attacked with Rekindling Phoenix.",
      "better_line": "Attack with both Sinister Concierge and Rekindling Phoenix since no opponents have blockers, dealing an additional 2 free damage.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 233,
      "player": "Gem25P Lucky",
      "decision_index": 98,
    }
  ],
